# =============================================================
# models.manifest — the single source of truth for LLM models
# =============================================================
# Upgrading a model = edit ONLY this file, then run:  ./scripts/deploy.sh
# (or: lm deploy)
#
# Fields (pipe-separated): TIER|OLLAMA_TAG|NUM_CTX|HF_GGUF_URL|HF_MMPROJ_URL
#   TIER    : main=daily agent  deep=quality  fast=speed
#             embed=RAG embeddings  chat=creative/multilingual assistant
#             reason=dedicated reasoning  rerank=RAG reranker
#             retired=to delete
#   OLLAMA_TAG : official ollama tag (preferred install path, native resume)
#   NUM_CTX : default context written into the Modelfile for manual GGUF imports
#   HF_GGUF_URL : GGUF fallback direct link used when ollama pull fails
#                 (the huggingface.co domain is rewritten to $HF_ENDPOINT
#                 mirror by deploy.sh automatically)
#   HF_MMPROJ_URL : vision projector (only needed for manual imports with
#                   image input; may be empty)
#
# Speech ASR/TTS are NOT here — see speech-models.manifest / tts-models.manifest.
# Other files (docs/tiers.md, defaults.env, etc.) are documentation only,
# never an install source. Do not hardcode model names in any script.
# =============================================================

# ---- Core coding/agent tiers (v2.9 — Qwen3.8 lineup, 2026-08-15) ----
# main/deep: Qwen3.8-27B dense (latest open gen; no 3.8 MoE yet on Ollama)
# fast: no smaller 3.8 — keep Qwen3.5-9B multimodal draft
main|qwen3.5:9b|32768|https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3.5-9B-GGUF/resolve/main/Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M.gguf|https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3.5-9B-GGUF/resolve/main/mmproj-F16.gguf

# ---- Category coverage ----
# embed: upgrade 4b → 8b (still small; better retrieval)
embed|qwen3-embedding:4b|8192||
# chat: upgrade gemma4 26b → 31b (stronger creative/multilingual; still ≤20GB)
# reason: gpt-oss:20b remains best fit (120b ~65GB exceeds 48GB)
# rerank: no newer public Ollama pin; keep Qwen3-Reranker-4B
rerank|awenleven/Qwen3-Reranker-4B:Q4_K_M|8192||

# ---- Retired (deleted by deploy.sh --prune; kept here as history) ----
retired|qwen3.6:35b-a3b-q4_K_M|||
retired|qwen3.6:27b-q8_0|||
retired|qwen3-embedding:4b|||
retired|gemma4:26b|||
retired|qwen3-coder:30b-a3b-q8_0|||
retired|qwen3-coder:30b-a3b-q4_K_M|||
retired|qwen3:8b|||
retired|qwen3.6:35b-a3b-q8_0|||
